  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1103780291530719333/deuf-refabricated.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"201\"></p>\n<h5><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=88b930&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Support&color=393939&labelColor=88b930&style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a></h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;&nbsp;</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>DEUF Refabricated</strong> 是 CAS-ual-TY 的 <a href=\"https://github.com/CAS-ual-TY/DuplicateEntityUUIDFix\" rel=\"nofollow\">DEUF（重复实体 UUID 修复器）</a> 模组的 Fabric 移植版。它可以修复重复的 UUID，消除日志刷屏问题，并解决部分崩溃。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组仅需安装在服务器上即可生效。但建议在整合包中包含此模组，以便在单人游戏中也能修复相关问题。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">实体仅在生成时会被修复，这意味着如果你的世界中已经存在重复实体，本模组无法自动修正，你需要手动移除它们。安装此模组后生成的新实体将不会再出现重复。</p>",
